[[2047,31,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           (left\nand right)</p><p>It is advisable to place the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the end of the front bumper.</p><p>2. Release the wheel arch liner from the front bumper using the\nspecial tool in the area where the bolts were removed.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.823.014.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Working from the bottom, undo the two bolts securing the bumper\nto the wing.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018790.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,31,0,"<p>1. Undo the centre bolts fastening the bumper.</p><p>2. Move the bumper slightly and support it appropriately.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018791.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,31,0,"<p>1. Undo the three nuts fastening the headlamp.</p><p>2. Move the headlamp and disconnect the electrical connections (2a,\n2b, 2c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Left headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235977\">F10A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Left headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235983\">F10B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235988\">F11A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235997\">F11B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2c</p></td><td><p>Left headlamp alignment corrector motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237000\">N30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2c</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp alignment corrector motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237001\">N31</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018792.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,31,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the lamp is not damaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections and\nrefit the lamp.</p><p>Tighten the three headlamp fixing nuts.</p><p>Reposition the side part of the bumper.</p><p>Tighten the centre bolts fastening the\nbumper.</p><p>Working from the bottom, tighten the two\nbolts securing the bumper to the wing.</p><p>Fit the wheel arch liner on the front bumper.</p><p>Tighten the bolts securing the ends of\nthe front bumper.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           (left\nand right)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a></p>"],[2047,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           (right and\nleft).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>It is advisable to place the vehicle\non a lift.</p></aside><p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the end of the front bumper.</p><p>2. Release the wheel arch liner from the front bumper using the\nspecial tool in the area where the bolts were removed.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.823.014.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Working from the bottom, undo the two bolts securing the bumper\nto the wing.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018793.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,63,0,"<p>1. Undo the bumper&#x27;s central bolts.</p><p>2. Move the bumper slightly and support it appropriately.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018794.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,63,0,"<p>1. Undo the two nuts (1a) securing the light cluster and release\nthe bolt from the retainer (1b).</p><p>2. Move the light cluster and disconnect the electrical connections\n(2a, 2b, 2c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Left headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235977\">F10A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Left headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235983\">F10B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2c</p></td><td><p>Left headlamp alignment corrector motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237000\">N30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235988\">F11A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235997\">F11B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2c</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp alignment corrector motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237001\">N31</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018795.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the light cluster is not damaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections and\nrefit the light cluster.</p><p>Tighten the two nuts fastening the light\ncluster and attach the bolt on the retainer.</p><p>Reposition the side part of the bumper.</p><p>Tighten the bumper&#x27;s central bolts.</p><p>Working from the bottom, tighten the two\nbolts securing the bumper to the wing.</p><p>Fit the wheel arch liner on the front bumper.</p><p>Tighten the bolts securing the ends of\nthe front bumper.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           (left\nand right)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238449\">5540B38</a></p>"]]